- Funds or other assets that are wholly or jointly owned or controlled, directly or indirectly, by designated persons or entities;
- Funds or other assets derived or generated from funds or other assets owned or controlled directly or indirectly by designated persons or entities;
- Funds or other assets of persons and entities acting on behalf of, or at the direction of designated persons or entities.

